WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Maybe on Sunday, actually.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.560
And we'll see.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.880
But there's a very good chance negotiations are going along very well.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:16.160
We're dealing with Hamas and many of the countries, as you know, we have Muslim, all of the Muslim

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.680
countries are included.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.600
All of the Arab countries are included.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.080
Very rich countries and some that are not so rich, but just about everybody's included.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.320
It's never happened before.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.360
Nothing like that's happened before and our final negotiation, as you know, is with Hamas.

